{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":58,"count":32,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L08-1-24\",\"時間\",\"時間\",\"时间\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"好，我們找時間一起去。","pinyin":"Hǎo, wǒmen zhǎo shíjiān yìqǐ qù.","english":"Okay, let’s make time for it.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-1-01","sourceFront":"裙子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"可是這些時間我都有語言交換，不能去。","pinyin":"Kěshì zhèxiē shíjiān wǒ dōu yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, bù néng qù.","english":"But I will be doing language exchange during that time. I can’t make it.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"別的時間可以嗎？","pinyin":"Biéde shíjiān kěyǐ ma?","english":"Can you swap the time?","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我朋友最近比較忙，別的時間他沒有空。","pinyin":"Wǒ péngyǒu zuìjìn bǐjiào máng, biéde shíjiān tā méi yǒukòng.","english":"My friend is busier lately; he isn’t available at other times.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"時(time) + 間(space): time is the space in which things happen."},{"key":"[\"B1L15-3-15\",\"猪\",\"豬\",\"猪\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L02-2-14\",\"蟲子\",\"蟲子\",\"虫子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"夏天到了，天氣熱了，蟲子也多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-14","sourceFront":"蟲子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"想把菜園照顧好，平時就得多用心，看到蟲子就得處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-54","sourceFront":"用心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想導演一部以蟲子當作主角的電影，真不是件容易的事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-05","sourceFront":"導演","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-1-24\",\"地\",\"地\",\"地\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"（看地圖）啊！天美飯店在這裡！我知道這個地方，附近有郵局跟超級市場。","pinyin":"(Kàn dìtú) A! Tiānměi Fàndiàn zài zhèlǐ! Wǒ zhīdào zhè ge dìfang, fùjìn yǒu yóujú gēn chāojíshìchǎng.","english":"(Looking at the map) Ah! So here is Tianmei Hotel! I know this place. There is a post office and a supermarket nearby.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-2-01","sourceFront":"路/馬路","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我也不知道。我們可以先上網看地圖。","pinyin":"Wǒ yě bù zhīdào. Wǒmen kěyǐ xiān shàngwǎng kàn dìtú.","english":"I don’t know either. We can check the map online first.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-1-01","sourceFront":"怎麼","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"an 土(earth) with 也(also) rests spread wide → the open 地(ground)."},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-03\",\"豆漿\",\"豆漿\",\"豆浆\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"老婆：我叫你買豆漿，怎麼買了無糖的，真難喝！ 老公：妳又沒說清楚，怎麼能怪我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-32","sourceFront":"怪","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我爺爺習慣吃中式早餐，每天早上都是吃包子配豆漿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-36","sourceFront":"中式","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-28\",\"谈恋爱\",\"談戀愛\",\"谈恋爱\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"佳佳認為談戀愛的對象，年齡不重要，容不容易溝通、個性適不適合才是最重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-24","sourceFront":"年齡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"談戀愛時不能太花心，(也)就是說不能見一個就愛一個。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-46","sourceFront":"就是說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-31\",\"溫暖\",\"溫暖\",\"温暖\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"愛心服務社社員去安養院陪老人過年，讓老人們感覺相當溫暖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-30","sourceFront":"相當","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"小藍從小在育幼院長大，最大的願望就是將來能有一個溫暖的家庭。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-29","sourceFront":"願望","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"管先生這段時間忙著布置新房子，希望給老婆一個又舒適又溫暖的家。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-17","sourceFront":"布置","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"母親為家人親手織了幾件毛衣，希望讓大家過個溫暖的冬天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-35","sourceFront":"織","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條棉被是用品質很好的棉花做的，裡面的棉又白又溫暖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-16","sourceFront":"棉花","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我喜歡陪家人到公園的草地上野餐，氣氛溫暖又歡喜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-46","sourceFront":"歡喜","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在冬天的深夜裡，坐在溫暖的地毯上靜靜地看書是一種享受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-14","sourceFront":"地毯","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-1-26\",\"地点\",\"地點\",\"地点\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"公司的生產部門這個月規劃了員工旅遊，有三個不同地點讓大家選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-02","sourceFront":"規劃","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"背包客為了解省交通費，經常搭別人的車到下一個地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-01","sourceFront":"背包客","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家民宿的地點實在太偏僻了，除了路不好走，附近也沒人住，想找個人問路都難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-27","sourceFront":"偏僻","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司向每位員工發出健檢通知，上面寫著檢查時間、地點和需要注意的事情","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-19","sourceFront":"發出","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我伯伯在鄉下有一塊土地，可是地點很偏僻，想賣也賣不掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-27","sourceFront":"土地","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"淡水的夕陽很美，如此的美麗風景，是約會的極佳地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-26","sourceFront":"如此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-22\",\"情侶裝\",\"情侶裝\",\"情侣装\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-22","sourceFront":"情侶裝","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他們特地穿上情侶裝出門，好像要告訴大家他們是幸福的情侶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-23","sourceFront":"情侶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"Matching clothes designed for romantic 情(emotion) and 侶(companion) pairs to 裝(dress): 情侶裝 means couples' matching outfits."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-10\",\"完全\",\"完全\",\"完全\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"超商常舉辦送小禮物或買一送一的活動，可是對王先生完全沒有吸引力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-10","sourceFront":"完全","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"小高總是在別人面前表現得很有禮貌，不過回到家就完全變了一個樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-11","sourceFront":"面前","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"父母要經常陪孩子聊天、玩遊戲，給零用錢不能完全滿足孩子的需要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-25","sourceFront":"需要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"李先生經常咳嗽，可是他完全不在意。直到今天咳得說不出話來了，才肯去看醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-09","sourceFront":"直到","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人以為身體沒什麼毛病就代表很健康，這樣的想法事實上不完全正確。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-06","sourceFront":"事實上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"完全按照別人的話來工作，是很省事沒錯，卻失去了讓自己進步的機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-42","sourceFront":"省事","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"汽車的汽油燃燒不完全的話，容易產生很多廢氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-49","sourceFront":"廢氣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"七歲以下的孩子對手部動作還無法完全地掌握，因此不應要求他們正確地握筆。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-32","sourceFront":"握","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人說好看的人像花瓶，好看卻沒有用，這句話我完全不同意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-36","sourceFront":"花瓶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這面金牌是完全用金子做的，外觀也相當獨特。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-52","sourceFront":"金牌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Reaching 完(complete) thoroughness covering the 全(whole) entirety: 完全 means completely."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-15\",\"设备\",\"設備\",\"设备\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這所大學有最新的電腦設備，提供學生很好的學習環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-15","sourceFront":"設備","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"為了提供學生良好的學習環境，學校改善了教室的設備，網路的速度也變快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-06","sourceFront":"良好","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠自從改善了設備以後，生產速度就一天比一天快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-01","sourceFront":"自從","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學生與校長當面對話，希望學校改善教學設備和校園餐廳的服務品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-17","sourceFront":"對話","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這棟大樓有安全系統的設備，小偷進去就會自動發出警告的聲音通知警察。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-08","sourceFront":"自動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對現代人來說，電腦和網路絕對是辦公室的主要設備。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-09","sourceFront":"主要","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座古老的城市因為公共設備太舊，購物也不方便，不少人都搬走了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-05","sourceFront":"古老","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為學校缺乏經費，宿舍的電腦設備暫時沒辦法改善。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-17","sourceFront":"經費","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家工廠的設備及員工都嚴重缺乏，哪裡有辦法進一步發展？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-39","sourceFront":"哪裡","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要是你想建議公司採購新設備，可以上網填採購單。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-11","sourceFront":"採購","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今年學校的預算只夠修理宿舍的衛生設備，其他需要改善的只能等到明年了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-16","sourceFront":"預算","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家醫院的內科有最新設備，因此成為許多病人的第一選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-18","sourceFront":"內科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這臺食品加工設備的構造相當複雜，其中約三分之一的零件還是由國外進口。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-05","sourceFront":"由","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-17\",\"節省\",\"節省\",\"节省\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"越來越多人選擇上網購物，有的是為了節省時間，有的是因為比價很方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-17","sourceFront":"節省","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"便利的交通，不僅縮短了南北城市的距離，也節省了人們寶貴的時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-28","sourceFront":"縮短","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"以電腦系統取代傳統收停車費的方式，能幫老闆節省工作人員的費用。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-05","sourceFront":"系統","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"像食物銀行、愛心冰箱此類處理食物的做法，不但可以節省資源，還能幫助需要的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-05","sourceFront":"此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我請旅行社代訂從台北直飛美國的班機，機票較貴，但能節省不少時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-44","sourceFront":"直飛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人們為了節省勞力，發明了許多實用的機械。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-37","sourceFront":"勞力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在人生地不熟的地方旅行時，如有當地人帶路，就可以節省不少時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-02","sourceFront":"帶路","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 節(festival) and 省(province): 節省 means save."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-11\",\"农业\",\"農業\",\"农业\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從六○年代開始，臺灣就提供農業方面的協助給許多國家，這點讓我覺得很驕傲。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-11","sourceFront":"農業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"科學家早就證明了氣溫的變化對農業生產有不好的影響，可是到目前還找不到解決的好辦法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-22","sourceFront":"證明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"許多國家因為工業進步得太快，反而使得農業慢慢不被重視了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-22","sourceFront":"工業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"小王對農業很有興趣，家裡的倉庫擺滿了種田用的工具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-17","sourceFront":"倉庫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L06-2-11\",\"感染\",\"感染\",\"感染\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"病人受傷的地方如果沒有好好處理，很容易會被感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-11","sourceFront":"感染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他手上有傷，醫師建議他三日以內不要碰水，以免感染。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-37","sourceFront":"傷","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L08-1-22\",\"關上\",\"關上\",\"关上\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"關上燈、關上手機，這麼做你才能好好休息。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-22","sourceFront":"關上","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-10\",\"指導\",\"指導\",\"指导\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在指導演員的表達方式上，這位導演的經驗相當豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-10","sourceFront":"指導","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-36\",\"重複\",\"重複\",\"重复\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個字不好念，我重複了好幾次，同學都說不對，害我好想放棄。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-36","sourceFront":"重複","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這本小說的內容重複性太高，一點新鮮感都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-35","sourceFront":"重複性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那件事我已經跟你重複說過好多次了，你怎麼還問我？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-07","sourceFront":"重複","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-2-03\",\"无论\",\"無論\",\"无论\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"無論發生什麼事，她都會跟父母商量，並參考他們的意見。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-03","sourceFront":"無論","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"無論做錯事或出差錯，任何人都應主動負起責任。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-23","sourceFront":"出","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"照顧還沒成年的孩子是父母應盡的責任，無論如何，既然生了就該養他、教導他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-25","sourceFront":"無論如何","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"錯誤通常來自粗心，因此無論事情大小都該用心處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-13","sourceFront":"來自","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":nul